text As soon as I open the door, something leaps into my vision.
text The floor right in front of me.
text Her bent legs are pointing in my direction.
text I don't even take my shoes off as I run inside toward her and hold her up.
music BGM01.mp3
text @[Tomoya]
text Nagisa!
text ......
text All I can hear from her are quiet, strained breaths. She doesn't reply to me.
text I touch her forehead. Her temperature is shockingly high.
text My head goes blank.
text I don't know what to do.
text Nagisa has collapsed with a fever.
text What am I supposed to do now?
text @[Tomoya]
text Nagisa...!
text For a while, all I'm able to do is hold her and call out her name again and again.
text @[Tomoya]
text (I should get her on a futon for now...)
