text I haphazardly toss a futon on the floor and lay her body down on top of it before finally remembering about Sanae-san.
text I grab the phone and begin to dial her number as I watch Nagisa's sweating face.
sound OKQ.aac
text @[Voice]
text "Yeah, this is Furukawa?"
text The old man.
text @[Tomoya]
text It's me! Please, can you put Sanae-san on?
sound OKR.aac
text @[Akio]
text "Yeah, one second."
text Sanae-san comes to the phone immediately.
sound OKS.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "Yes, this is Sanae."
text @[Tomoya]
text This is Tomoya. I found Nagisa collapsed on the floor, and she has a fever.
text @[Tomoya]
text It's a really high one.
text @[Tomoya]
text I don't know what to do, and...
sound OKT.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "Please calm down, Tomoya-san."
sound OKU.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "It's okay. I'll be right over."
text @[Tomoya]
text Y-Yes...?
sound OKV.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "For now, let her sleep on a futon, then wring out a wet towel and put it on her forehead, please."
text @[Tomoya]
text I understand...
sound OKW.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "Then please wait. I'll contact Yagi-san and have her rush over too."
text @[Tomoya]
text Thank you, please do.
text I hang up.
text At least I know what to do now.
text Wring a wet towel and put it on Nagisa's forehead.
text @[Tomoya]
text Just hold on, Nagisa.
text I stand up.
