text I remember two summers ago.
text I was by Nagisa's side, always holding her hand those days too.
text But right now, I can only do that at night.
text During the day, I still go to work as usual.
text I have to ask Sanae-san to take my place while I'm away.
text When I get home, Sanae-san prepares dinner and then returns to her own house.
text Day after day goes by like this.
text Nagisa's fever... refuses to go down.
