text The phone rings as I'm folding laundry.
text I pick it up to hear the old man's voice.
sound OLD.aac
text @[Akio]
text "Take tomorrow off work."
text @[Tomoya]
text Aren't you being a little rude? I can't just call off work with zero notice.
sound OLE.aac
