text "Tch... Then when's the next day you can take off?"
text @[Tomoya]
text I dunno. And even if they do let me take a day off, I might get called in at the last second.
sound OLG.aac
text @[Akio]
text "Well, figure it out. Or else I'm going to march right into your company, you asshole."
text @[Tomoya]
text What's the big deal? What do you wanna do once I have a day off, anyway?
sound OLH.aac
