text @[Akio]
text I'd play baseball with kids from town, space out, and relax here.
text I thought that he seemed to be always disappearing from work. So this is where he was going.
text I can't believe this guy.
sound OLX.aac
text @[Akio]
text They keep on clearing more and more of the nature around here, and now they want to put a huge building on this plot of land.
sound OLY.aac
text @[Akio]
text I can't play baseball here anymore obviously. And the view is terrible now.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
sound OLZ.aac
text @[Akio]
text This town keeps on changing.
sound OM0.aac
text @[Akio]
text But it doesn't seem like there's anything we can do about it.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah, seems that way...
text It wasn't just me. The old man feels the same way.
text It might be more than the two of us too. Maybe lots of people are thinking the same thing.
sound OM1.aac
text @[Akio]
text It's not like I'm interested in saving the trees or anything.
sound OM2.aac
text @[Akio]
text I think that the town ought to keep changing for the sake of the people who live in it.
sound OM3.aac
text @[Akio]
text @But, you know...
