sound OMD.aac
text @[Akio]
text It really was a tragic thing to have happen.
text The old man starts his story after he lets out a string of smoke.
sound OME.aac
text @[Akio]
text It was over a decade ago now.
sound OMF.aac
text @[Akio]
text At the time, I was a member of a theatrical company. I spent all day either at part-time jobs or at practice.
sound OMG.aac
text @[Akio]
text Sanae was teaching. She had a job at a private middle school nearby.
sound OMH.aac
text @[Akio]
text We were both doing the kind of work we had always wanted to do... And we were engrossed in it.
sound OMI.aac
text @[Akio]
text So Nagisa was always on her own.
sound OMJ.aac
text @[Akio]
text Since we were out all day, the only time she wasn't alone was at night.
sound OMK.aac
text @[Akio]
text And... she'd always be outside the gates of our house, waiting for us to come home.
sound OML.aac
text @[Akio]
text Sanae got home first most nights. Her job wasn't one that kept her there late very often.
sound OMM.aac
text @[Akio]
text So Nagisa would be outside, waiting...
sound OMN.aac
text @[Akio]
text ...And Sanae would take her little hand and lead her into the house.
sound OMO.aac
text @[Akio]
text And she'd always apologize...
sound OMP.aac
text @[Akio]
text Nagisa would shake her head and say "no," but Sanae says there were always tears welling up in her eyes.
sound OMQ.aac
text @[Akio]
text That's how we spent every day.
sound OMR.aac
text @[Akio]
text But one day, Nagisa got sick and developed a fever.
sound OMS.aac
text @[Akio]
text It was a cold day. Snow was collecting on the ground.
sound OMT.aac
text @[Akio]
text The kind of weather that no one would want to be outside in.
sound OMU.aac
text @[Akio]
text Around then... I was preparing for a big performance at the end of the year. As for Sanae, her students were about to take their exams.
sound OMV.aac
text @[Akio]
text Neither of us could afford to take any time off.
sound OMW.aac
text @[Akio]
text So we left the house with Nagisa in bed.
sound OMX.aac
text @[Akio]
text But...
sound OMY.aac
text @[Akio]
text Nagisa was waiting on that day too. Right in front of the gate.
sound OMZ.aac
text @[Akio]
text When I think back on it, I should've known that she'd do that.
sound ON0.aac
text @[Akio]
text But back then, we thought there was no way.
sound ON1.aac
text @[Akio]
text We should've noticed...
sound ON2.aac
text @[Akio]
text It was her way of doing everything she could to tell us.
sound ON3.aac
text @[Akio]
text Nagisa was always well-behaved and quiet...
sound ON4.aac
text @[Akio]
text ...So it was her way of telling us she wanted us to always be by her side.
sound ON5.aac
text @[Akio]
text Which is why she did the same thing as always that day...
sound ON6.aac
text @[Akio]
text She didn't care if she had a fever or not...
sound ON7.aac
text @[Akio]
text By the time I got home, Nagisa had collapsed in front of the house.
sound ON8.aac
text @[Akio]
text She was half-buried in snow.
sound ON9.aac
text @[Akio]
text What a terrible thing...
sound ONA.aac
text @[Akio]
text We weren't able to see the errors of our ways until they ended up hurting the one thing we loved most...
text @[Akio]
text ...
sound ONB.aac
text @[Akio]
text I took her in the house as fast as I could and called a doctor.
sound ONC.aac
text @[Akio]
text The doctor rushed over and did everything he could.
sound OND.aac
text @[Akio]
text But... her fever wouldn't go down...
sound ONE.aac
text @[Akio]
text By morning...
text @[Akio]
text ...
sound ONF.aac
text @[Akio]
text I never knew I could feel sadness like that...
sound ONG.aac
text @[Akio]
text Sanae and I had both given up hope...
sound ONH.aac
text @[Akio]
text It was like we found ourselves at the bottom of a deep, dark pit.
sound ONI.aac
text @[Akio]
text One we thought we'd never be able to climb out of...
sound ONJ.aac
text @[Akio]
text I held Nagisa's body...
sound ONK.aac
text @[Akio]
text And went outside.
sound ONL.aac
text @[Akio]
text All I could do now was pray.
sound ONM.aac
text @[Akio]
text I didn't want things to end that way...
sound ONN.aac
text @[Akio]
text I begged for my child to be saved...
sound ONO.aac
text @[Akio]
text I blindly ran around town...
sound ONP.aac
text @[Akio]
text @Until...
delay 111
text I found myself here.
